.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH AMIVULN-CHECK 1  amivuln 
.SH NAME
check \- Check packages, files, versions or purls
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcheck\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fITARGET\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check packages, files, versions or purls
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Check every installed package
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fITARGET\fR]
Targets to check
